      "message": "Hi James,\n\nThis change is motivated by some changes made by kmilos in msys2\nhttps://github.com/msys2/MINGW-packages/pull/12598/files#diff-6f0efefe10c6cb5a3d421f778426a8c3f91e7b09de42467a4d62edc33400c0e6R27\n\n\nThis change brings libwebp closer inline to projects such as abseil, llvm, qt, and boost, to name a few.\n\nThis does change the installed files since what would previously have been `/usr/lib/WebP/cmake` would now be `/usr/local/lib/cmake/WebP/` instead",
